AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan_1::
	.string "Hm? Who are you?\p"
	.string "{PLAYER}, eh? You want me to make\n"
	.string "some BALLS?\p"
	.string "Sorry, but that’ll have to wait.\p"
	.string "Do you know TEAM ROCKET? Ah, don’t\n"
	.string "worry. I’ll tell you anyhow.\p"
	.string "TEAM ROCKET’s an evil gang that\n"
	.string "uses POKéMON for their dirty work.\p"
	.string "They’re supposed to have disbanded\n"
	.string "three years ago.\p"
	.string "Anyway, they’re at the WELL, cutting\n"
	.string "off SLOWPOKETAILS for sale!\p"
	.string "So I’m going to give them a\n"
	.string "lesson in pain!\p"
	.string "Hang on, SLOWPOKE!\n"
	.string "Old KURT is on his way!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan_2::
	.string "KURT: I make BALLS from APRICORNS.\p"
	.string "Collect them from trees and bring ’em\n"
	.string "to me.\p"
	.string "I’ll make BALLS out of them.\n"
	.string "$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan_3::
	.string "KURT: Hi, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "You handled yourself like a real\n"
	.string "hero at the WELL.\p"
	.string "I like your style!\p"
	.string "I would be honored to make BALLS for\n"
	.string "a trainer like you.\p"
	.string "This is all I have now, but take it.$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan_4::
	.string "{PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "This BALL started to shake while I\n"
	.string "was checking it.\p"
	.string "There must be something to this!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan_6::
	.string "KURT: Ah, {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "I’ve just finished your BALL.\l"
	.string "Here!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan_7::
	.string "KURT: That turned out great.\n"
	.string "Try catching POKéMON with it.$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan_10::
	.string "You have a WHITE APRICORN, I could\n"
	.string "make a DIVE BALL out of it\l"
	.string "Do you want me to make one?$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan_11::
	.string "You have a GREEN APRICORN, I could\n"
	.string "make a LUXURY BALL out of it\l"
	.string "Do you want me to make one?$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan_12::
	.string "You have a BLACK APRICORN, I could\n"
	.string "make a TIMER BALL out of it\l"
	.string "Do you want me to make one?$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan_13::
	.string "You have a RED APRICORN, I could\n"
	.string "make a NEST BALL out of it\l"
	.string "Do you want me to make one?$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan_14::
	.string "You have a PINK APRICORN, I could\n"
	.string "make a REPEAT BALL out of it\l"
	.string "Do you want me to make one?$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan_15::
	.string "You have a BLUE APRICORN, I could\n"
	.string "make a NET BALL out of it\l"
	.string "Do you want me to make one?$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan_16::
	.string "You have a YELLOW APRICORN, I could\n"
	.string "make a PREMIER BALL out of it\l"
	.string "Do you want me to make one?$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan_17::
	.string "It’ll take a while to make the BALL.\p"
	.string "Come back for it later.$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_LittleGirl_1::
	.string "The SLOWPOKE are gone... Were they\n"
	.string "taken away by a bad people?$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_LittleGirl_2::
	.string "Grandpa’s gone...\n"
	.string "I’m so lonely...$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_LittleGirl_3::
	.string "The SLOWPOKE my Dad gave me came\n"
	.string "back! Its TAIL is growing back too!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_BaldingMan2::
	.string "KURT: I’m working!\n"
	.string "Don’t bother me!$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_KurtWhatIsThat::
	.string "Wh-what is that?\p"
	.string "I’ve never seen one before.\p"
	.string "It looks a lot like a POKé BALL, but\n"
	.string "it appears to be something else.\p"
	.string "Let me check it for you.$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_KurtImCheckingItNow::
	.string "I’m checking it now.$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_KurtAhHaISee::
	.string "Ah-ha! I see!\n"
	.string "So...$"

AzaleaTown_Interior5_Text_LittleGirlGSBall::
	.string "Grandpa’s checking a BALL right now.\p"
	.string "So I’m waiting till he’s done.$"
